                  "content": "• ≤ 900px: header-owned, non-modal disclosure.\n• aria-expanded + aria-controls on trigger.\n• Tab reaches visible links normally; no focus trap.\n• Escape closes and returns focus to trigger.\n• Selecting a section anchor closes the menu.\n• Hidden links are not tabbable.\n• Active state: underline + weight + marker; aria-current for the current section.\n• Desktop navigation remains visible above 900px.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "aIveJ",
                  "name": "Navigation routes",
                  "fill": "#55594F",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Intended anchors: #jak-to-funguje and #portfolio-lab. Sign-in and start use the existing application/authentication flow: exact destinations require codebase verification. Do not invent a new onboarding route.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "czuho",
                  "name": "Navigation implementation caveat",
                  "fill": "#55594F",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "These are static specified states, not a working menu. Disclosure expansion moves content in flow; no scroll-jacking or modal scrim. Keyboard, screen-reader and device behavior still require browser testing.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Gk4EY",
          "name": "Policy heading",
          "fill": "$investi-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "07 / Marketing preview contract",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Omb4h",
          "name": "Preview policy",
          "fill": "#55594F",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "V14.1 landing previews are NONINTERACTIVE illustrations of product states. “Ukázka…” appears at the entry to each example. Their Continue/Save/answer/slider shapes do not award XP, save, unlock or impersonate an authenticated visitor. Render a readable example, not disabled fake controls; keep them out of the tab sequence. An interactive demo would be a separate explicit scope and must not be silently substituted.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "AghmK",
          "name": "Motion handoff",
          "fill": "#55594F",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Static state is authoritative. Optional hero entrance: opacity + up to 12px translation, 320ms; Lab reveal: opacity + up to 16px, 420ms, once. Reduced motion: no movement, final state visible. Figure + grip crops are one registered unit; no loops, no pinned scrolling, no forced delays. Actual Motion implementation must be verified.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
