                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Danger is not error. Error Ink (#A63D28) reports something that went wrong; Danger marks an action the learner chooses that removes data. On the page it is always the quiet outline button; the filled Danger button appears only inside the confirmation dialog, next to a secondary “Zrušit” that keeps the default focus. No red backgrounds, no warning triangles, no exclamation marks.",
